{"seq":3,"slug":"recurrence-window-materialization-perf","title":"有界窗口物化与展开性能：无限规则、缓存与 DST/DoS 边界处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/calendar-scheduling-icalendar-rrule-caldav-availability/rrule-recurrence-expansion/recurrence-window-materialization-perf","wordCount":2575,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"有界窗口物化与展开性能-无限规则-缓存与-dst-dos-边界处理\">有界窗口物化与展开性能：无限规则、缓存与 DST/DoS 边界处理</h1><p><code>RRULE:FREQ=DAILY</code> 只有 17 个字符，却代表一个<strong>永不停歇的序列</strong>——RFC 5545 §3.3.10 的原话是：若既无 <code>COUNT</code> 也无 <code>UNTIL</code>，这条规则&quot;is considered to repeat forever&quot;（来源：RFC 5545 §3.3.10，rfc-editor.org）。任何真实系统都不可能把「永远」存下来，于是日历工程的核心动作只有一句话：<strong>在某个有界窗口内，把无限规则物化（materialize）成一组有限的实例</strong>。窗口的选法、物化的成本、以及物化结果能不能被安全地缓存，决定了这套系统是能扛住一万个用户，还是会在某个用户上传一条 <code>FREQ=SECONDLY</code> 的规则时整体瘫痪。本篇聚焦这条「从无限到有界」的转换，语法层面的展开语义见 <a href=\"rrule-grammar-semantics\">RRULE 语法与语义</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-物化是有界窗口上的投影\">核心概念：物化是有界窗口上的投影</h2><p>一条 <code>VEVENT</code> 存的是<strong>规则</strong>，而用户要的是<strong>某段时间里具体有哪些会</strong>。这两者之间的映射就是物化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>materialize</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>DTSTART</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{materialize}(R, [T_s, T_e)) = \\{\\, t \\mid t = R^{(i)} \\cdot \\text{DTSTART},\\ t \\in [T_s, T_e),\\ i \\ge 0 \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">materialize</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DTSTART</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^{(i)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示按 <code>FREQ</code>/<code>INTERVAL</code> 推进并施加 <code>BYxxx</code> 后的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个有效实例。窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[T_s, T_e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 通常来自三类调用方：用户的「本月视图」、CalDAV <code>calendar-query</code> 的 <code>time-range</code> 过滤器、以及忙闲查询（free/busy）。三种场景的窗口粒度与实例数上限完全不同，但<strong>都必须有界</strong>——这正是 RFC 4791 对 <code>calendar-query</code> 的硬性要求：服务器&quot;<strong>MUST</strong> expand recurring components to determine whether any recurrence instances overlap the specified time range&quot;（来源：RFC 4791 §7.8，rfc-editor.org）。注意它说的是「判断是否重叠」，不要求把窗口内所有实例都吐回给客户端；这两者的区分是后面 DoS 防护的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[存储的 VEVENT + RRULE&lt;br/&gt;可能是无限序列] --&gt; B[接收有界窗口请求&lt;br/&gt;时间范围 + 实例上限]&#10;    B --&gt; C{窗口起点是否等于 DTSTART}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[快进 seek 到窗口起点&lt;br/&gt;fastForward / after]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[从 DTSTART 起步]&#10;    D --&gt; F[在窗口内迭代产出实例]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G{是否触发终止条件}&#10;    G --&gt;|实例数达上限| H[截断并返回部分结果]&#10;    G --&gt;|越过窗口终点| I[正常结束]&#10;    G --&gt;|规则 COUNT/UNTIL 耗尽| I&#10;    H --&gt; J[物化结果写入缓存&lt;br/&gt;按内容哈希 + 窗口键]&#10;    I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    A[存储的 VEVENT + RRULE&lt;br/&gt;可能是无限序列] --&gt; B[接收有界窗口请求&lt;br/&gt;时间范围 + 实例上限]\n    B --&gt; C{窗口起点是否等于 DTSTART}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[快进 seek 到窗口起点&lt;br/&gt;fastForward / after]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[从 DTSTART 起步]\n    D --&gt; F[在窗口内迭代产出实例]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G{是否触发终止条件}\n    G --&gt;|实例数达上限| H[截断并返回部分结果]\n    G --&gt;|越过窗口终点| I[正常结束]\n    G --&gt;|规则 COUNT/UNTIL 耗尽| I\n    H --&gt; J[物化结果写入缓存&lt;br/&gt;按内容哈希 + 窗口键]\n    I --&gt; J</pre><p>图中「快进」这一支是性能分水岭。没有它，一次「查 2026 年 10 月的会议」会先从头生成 2019 年以来全部实例——成本与窗口起点距 <code>DTSTART</code> 的历史长度成正比，而不是与窗口长度成正比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"窗口的四个边界-时间-实例数-资源大小-日期域\">窗口的四个边界：时间、实例数、资源大小、日期域</h2><p>一个稳健的物化接口至少要显式接受四个边界，缺一不可。它们并非拍脑袋设计，而是逐条对应 CalDAV 规范里服务器必须声明的能力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>边界</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>规范/实现依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[T_s, T_e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>限定要展开哪一段</td>\n<td>RFC 4791 <code>time-range</code> 过滤器；Google Calendar <code>timeMin</code>/<code>timeMax</code>（RFC3339，<code>timeMin</code> 对结束时间排他）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单资源实例上限</td>\n<td>单条规则最多产出多少实例</td>\n<td><code>CALDAV:max-instances</code>，超限则 PUT/COPY/MOVE 触发前置条件失败（RFC 4791 §5.2.3）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应实例上限</td>\n<td>单次查询最多返回多少条</td>\n<td><code>DAV:number-of-matches-within-limits</code> 后置条件；Google <code>maxResults</code> 默认 250、硬上限 2500</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日期域</td>\n<td>允许的绝对日期范围</td>\n<td><code>CALDAV:min-date-time</code> / <code>CALDAV:max-date-time</code>，另有 <code>CALDAV:max-resource-size</code> 限制资源字节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中最容易被忽视的是**「响应实例上限」与「单资源实例上限」是两回事**。前者约束一次查询跨越多少个资源（多条 <code>VEVENT</code>），后者约束单条 <code>VEVENT</code> 能展开出多少个实例。一条 <code>FREQ=DAILY;COUNT=10000</code> 的规则可能单资源不超限，却在某次跨十年的查询里让响应膨胀到无法序列化。Google Calendar 的做法是把展开与分页绑定：<code>singleEvents=true</code> 时把重复事件展成一次性实例，<code>maxResults</code> 默认 250、单页最大 2500，靠 <code>nextPageToken</code> 分页（来源：Google Calendar API v3，events.list 参考，developers.google.com）。这就是「宁可分页、不可一次性物化」的工程取向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"展开成本模型-从-o-历史-到-o-窗口\">展开成本模型：从 O(历史) 到 O(窗口)</h2><p>朴素实现的成本可以用历史跨度除以周期长度粗估。设窗口起点为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、周期为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>、<code>INTERVAL</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，从 <code>DTSTART</code> 顺序迭代到窗口起点需要推进的次数约为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>seek</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>DTSTART</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_\\text{seek} \\approx \\left\\lfloor \\frac{T_s - \\text{DTSTART}}{k \\cdot \\Delta} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seek</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DTSTART</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一条 2015 年创建、<code>FREQ=DAILY</code> 的规则，在 2026 年被查询时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>seek</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>4000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_\\text{seek} \\approx 4000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seek</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4000</span></span></span></span></span>。单条无所谓，但当一次跨资源查询要物化上千条这样的规则，成本就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>资源数</mtext><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>seek</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\text{资源数} \\times N_\\text{seek})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">资源数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seek</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，且<strong>每次请求都要重算</strong>。真正的解法是两层的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>快进（fast-forward / seek）</strong>：<code>rrule.js</code> 的 <code>after(dt, inc)</code> 与 <code>before(dt, inc)</code> 直接返回边界附近的下一个/上一个实例，<code>between(after, before, inc)</code> 返回区间内全部实例——它们把「先跳到窗口起点」这件事从调用方的手写循环变成库的职责（来源：rrule.js 文档，github.com/jkbrzt/rrule）。Python 的 <code>dateutil.rrule</code> 提供同构的 <code>after</code> / <code>before</code> / <code>between</code> 与生成器 <code>xafter</code>，并且 <code>cache=True</code> 会在<strong>同一规则被反复查询</strong>时复用已生成的实例（来源：dateutil rrule 文档，dateutil.readthedocs.io）。</li>\n<li><strong>物化结果缓存</strong>：同一 <code>(规则, 窗口)</code> 的展开结果在窗口内是确定的，可以按内容哈希缓存，把重复查询降到一次查找。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>需要警惕的是库的<strong>默认行为并不设界</strong>。rrule.js 文档明确说明 it documents <strong>no built-in maximum iteration count or automatic cutoff</strong>——安全边界只有 <code>count</code>、<code>until</code>、有界的 <code>between()</code>、<code>before()</code>/<code>after()</code>，或让迭代器回调返回假值（来源：rrule.js 文档）。也就是说，<code>all()</code> 用在无限规则上会一直跑下去；库不会替你兜底。生产代码里应把 <code>all()</code> 列为禁用 API，统一走有界查询。</p>\n<p>一个具体的缓存键设计如下——注意把「影响展开结果的每一个输入」都纳入哈希，否则会出现「改了时区、缓存还是旧结果」的静默错误：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"key = H( uid ‖ sequence ‖ recurrence-id ‖ DTSTART ‖ RRULE&#10;         ‖ EXDATE ‖ RDATE ‖ VTIMEZONE-block-hash&#10;         ‖ window.start ‖ window.end ‖ instance_cap )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>key = H( uid ‖ sequence ‖ recurrence-id ‖ DTSTART ‖ RRULE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ‖ EXDATE ‖ RDATE ‖ VTIMEZONE-block-hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ‖ window.start ‖ window.end ‖ instance_cap )</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>sequence</code>（RFC 5545 中用于标识事件修订的序号，CalDAV 侧对应 <code>ETag</code>/<code>CTag</code>）进键是必须的：任何一端更新了规则，哈希就变，旧缓存自然失效，无需显式失效逻辑。这类「内容寻址 + 隐式失效」比手工维护「哪些缓存要清」要可靠得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dst-与本地墙钟-物化时刻的正确姿势\">DST 与本地墙钟：物化时刻的正确姿势</h2><p>重复事件最阴险的一类 bug 出在夏令时切换：规则本身（如 <code>FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO</code>）是在<strong>本地墙钟</strong>语义下定义的，而实例的绝对时刻是 UTC 瞬间。二者在 DST 边界上会错位。<code>dateutil</code> 文档复述了 RFC 的判定原则：&quot;Such recurrence instances <strong>MUST be ignored and MUST NOT be counted</strong> as part of the recurrence set&quot;——即<strong>不存在的墙钟时刻（春季跳表被跳过的那一小时）应被整体丢弃，且不占用 <code>count</code> 名额</strong>；同时文档指出，<strong>秋季回拨产生重复的那一小时，其行为未被规范明确规定</strong>（来源：dateutil rrule 文档）。这是一个真实的互操作性陷阱：两个日历服务器对同一规则的展开可能差一个实例。</p>\n<p>时区本身的解析（<code>VTIMEZONE</code> 的 <code>STANDARD</code>/<code>DAYLIGHT</code> 子组件、<code>RRULE</code> 加 <code>RDATE</code> 的组合定义）不在本篇范围，见 <a href=\"../icalendar-model-timezone/vtimezone-dst-offset-resolution\">VTIMEZONE 与 DST 偏移解析</a>。物化阶段要守的纪律只有两条：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>先按墙钟展开，再逐实例解析成绝对时刻</strong>。不要把规则的所有实例算成 UTC 再加减偏移——DST 切换点前后偏移不同，整体平移必错。</li>\n<li><strong>存储保留原始墙钟与 <code>TZID</code>，同时缓存解析后的 UTC 瞬间</strong>。前者是重放规则所需要的，后者是排序、比较、发提醒所需要的。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><code>UNTIL</code> 的值类型也要在物化前校验：RFC 5545 规定 <code>UNTIL</code> &quot;<strong>MUST</strong> have the same value type as the <code>DTSTART</code> property&quot;，且当 <code>DTSTART</code> 带时区或为 UTC 时，<code>UNTIL</code> &quot;<strong>MUST</strong> be specified in a <strong>UTC</strong> time format&quot;（来源：RFC 5545 §3.3.10）。一个常见缺陷是客户端写了本地时间的 <code>UNTIL</code>，服务器按 UTC 解析，窗口末尾凭空多出或少掉一个实例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dos-边界-把用户可控的规则当作不可信输入\">DoS 边界：把用户可控的规则当作不可信输入</h2><p><code>RRULE</code> 是<strong>用户供给、服务器执行</strong>的表达式，等价于一段参数化的循环。它有明确的放大效应：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>FREQ=SECONDLY</code> 在一年窗口里就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>365</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>86400</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>3.15</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">365 \\times 86400 \\approx 3.15 \\times 10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">365</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">86400</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个候选实例；</li>\n<li><code>FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=1,2,...;BYDAY=...;BYSETPOS=...</code> 这类组合会在一轮里生成大量中间候选再筛选；</li>\n<li><code>RDATE</code> 可以携带任意多个显式日期，<code>EXDATE</code>/<code>EXRULE</code> 同样可被滥用；</li>\n<li>嵌套/递归的 <code>VTIMEZONE</code> 定义会放大解析成本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此物化层必须把「展开」当成一个<strong>有配额的计算任务</strong>来对待，而不是一次纯粹的函数调用。可以落地的四道闸门：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>入口校验</strong>：拒绝 <code>UNTIL</code> 与 <code>COUNT</code> 同时出现（RFC 5545 的 ABNF 注释写明 &quot;they MUST NOT occur in the same &#39;recur&#39;&quot;，来源同上）；拒绝 <code>CALDAV:min-date-time</code> / <code>max-date-time</code> 之外的绝对日期；对 <code>RDATE</code>/<code>EXDATE</code> 条目数设上限。</li>\n<li><strong>展开期熔断</strong>：迭代过程中累计实例数，一旦触及 <code>max-instances</code> 或查询级实例上限立刻截断并标注「结果不完整」，而不是继续跑完。</li>\n<li><strong>时间预算</strong>：给单条规则的展开设 wall-clock 上限，超时降级为「只回答是否重叠」（这正是 RFC 4791 允许的——<code>calendar-query</code> 只要求判断 overlap，不要求全量展开）。</li>\n<li><strong>响应侧裁剪</strong>：用 <code>CALDAV:limit-recurrence-set</code>（返回主组件 + 影响窗口的覆盖组件）与 <code>CALDAV:expand</code>（把重叠实例展成 <code>RECURRENCE-ID</code> 的单实例组件）控制返回体积，二者语义不同、不可混用（来源：RFC 4791 §9.6.5/§9.6.6）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>calendar-query</code> 的后置条件 <code>DAV:number-of-matches-within-limits</code> 给了服务器一个合法出口：当匹配数超出服务器自定义上限时，可以返回错误而非硬撑（来源：RFC 4791）。把它当作上游限流的信号，比让进程 OOM 要体面得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>无限规则必须被有界窗口物化</strong>，四个边界缺一不可：时间范围、单资源实例上限、响应实例上限、允许的日期域。规范里它们分别对应 <code>time-range</code>、<code>CALDAV:max-instances</code>、<code>DAV:number-of-matches-within-limits</code>、<code>CALDAV:min-date-time</code>/<code>max-date-time</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>成本必须与窗口长度成正比，而非与历史长度成正比</strong>。用 <code>after</code>/<code>between</code> 快进，配合内容寻址缓存，把重复查询从「重算」降为「查找」。</li>\n<li><strong>缓存键要覆盖所有影响展开的输入</strong>（含 <code>sequence</code>/<code>ETag</code> 与 <code>VTIMEZONE</code> 哈希），让规则更新自动失效缓存，而不是靠手工清除。</li>\n<li><strong>DST 是物化的语义边界</strong>：不存在的墙钟实例「MUST be ignored and MUST NOT be counted」，重复小时的行为未定义；先按墙钟展开再逐实例解析成 UTC 瞬间。<code>UNTIL</code> 的值类型必须与 <code>DTSTART</code> 一致，带时区时必须是 UTC。</li>\n<li><strong>把 <code>RRULE</code> 当不可信输入</strong>：入口校验、展开期熔断、时间预算、响应侧裁剪四道闸门，缺一即可能被一条 <code>FREQ=SECONDLY</code> 规则打垮。</li>\n<li>库不会替你设界——rrule.js 明确不提供自动迭代上限。生产代码应禁用无界 <code>all()</code>，统一走有界查询。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"有界窗口物化与展开性能：无限规则、缓存与 DST/DoS 边界处理","id":"有界窗口物化与展开性能-无限规则-缓存与-dst-dos-边界处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：物化是有界窗口上的投影","id":"核心概念-物化是有界窗口上的投影"},{"level":2,"text":"窗口的四个边界：时间、实例数、资源大小、日期域","id":"窗口的四个边界-时间-实例数-资源大小-日期域"},{"level":2,"text":"展开成本模型：从 O(历史) 到 O(窗口)","id":"展开成本模型-从-o-历史-到-o-窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"DST 与本地墙钟：物化时刻的正确姿势","id":"dst-与本地墙钟-物化时刻的正确姿势"},{"level":2,"text":"DoS 边界：把用户可控的规则当作不可信输入","id":"dos-边界-把用户可控的规则当作不可信输入"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"重复展开算法：展开引擎、EXDATE/RDATE 与 RECURRENCE-ID 覆盖实例","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/calendar-scheduling-icalendar-rrule-caldav-availability/rrule-recurrence-expansion/recurrence-expansion-algorithm"},"next":{"title":"忙闲数据模型：VFreeBusy、FREEBUSY 区间与 TRANSP/可见性语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/calendar-scheduling-icalendar-rrule-caldav-availability/freebusy-availability-scheduling/freebusy-vfreebusy-model"}}